title: Gallax takes power.
subtitle: The beginning of the end.
view-if: (chancellor == royalist_chancellor or president == "Gallax" or president == "Gorrick" or president == "Frask" or chancellor_party == "Royalist") and (not rubicon_mini or president == "Gallax" or president == "Gorrick" or president == "Frask")
on-arrival: marcher_in_government = 0
tags: event
new-page: true

[? if gallax_deported and president != "Gallax" and chancellor != "Gallax": The first act that Chancellor [+ chancellor +] takes upon assuming office is bringing Alaric Gallax back to the Commonwealth, and giving him citizenship and an official cabinet position. ?]

Gallax has promised a campaign of revenge against the <span style="color: #c00000;">socialists</span>, and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> have already spilled much blood on the streets. In his published manifesto, he promises a campaign of <span style="color: #7e0000;">**unspeakable**</span> <span style="color: #3f0000;">**horror**</span> against our <span style="color: #005EB8;">Jews</span>, and endless wars of violent expansion that will ruin all of Europe.

What are we to do now?

- @fight: We will fight on the streets to prevent Gallax from taking power.
- @give_up: We will vote against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> in the Assembly.


@fight

Do we realize that this means civil war, against the full force of the state?

- @civil_war: Yes.
- @give_up: We are not ready for war. Instead, we will vote against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> in the Assembly.

@give_up
on-arrival: in_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; in_grand_coalition_heartland = 0; in_minority_grand_coalition_heartland = 0; in_popular_front_heartland = 0; in_left_front_heartland = 0; in_marcher_majority_heartland = 0; in_center_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_far_right_coalition_heartland = 1; in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; marcher_heartland = 0; right_heartland = 0; heartland_leader = "Goodryke" if president != "Gallax"; heartland_leader = "Goring" if president = "Gallax"

Speeches are made. Votes are held. Bullets fly in the streets. Some <span style="color: #c00000;">socialists</span> are killed or jailed. Others flee the country. What can votes even do at this juncture?

The Assembly is burned, ostensibly by a foreign <span style="color: #700000;">communist</span>. In the wake, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> pass decrees giving them unlimited power. They, combined with the [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if dnf_formed: <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>?], will win a majority at the next elections.

the Commonwealth is lost.

- @game_over: Game over.
